2 CONC  Ferencik</p><p>&nbsp;and about where it came from, he said the man, who was in America, where he</p><p>&nbsp;met with Michael and Maria, and then returned to Sromowce.</p><p>&nbsp;The priest, who was
2 CONC  shot by the Germans and forced to dig own grave</p><p>&nbsp;you&#39;ve never heard of. Also, nobody knows about it to our families </p><p>&nbsp;Cichon Sromowce came from a priest.</p><p>&nbsp;Best re
