1 NOTE Thinking about some of the things my Mary used to say in Polish. When you got nothing (shit) she would say you got gowno and it was pronounced goovno. She also sometimes said Hovno but I don't know th
2 CONC e spelling of that one. Especially when getting a ticket to win something she would say she won goovno.  <p></p>
