1 NOTE Steve T. Cichon was born December 15, 1910.  Steve married Angeline ("Nellie") Jankura and had two sons, one of whom was a lawyer, now retired in FL.  Steve worked at the Piney Fork Mine's "tipple," a
2 CONC  place for screening coal and loading it into rail cars or trucks.  Steve died January 6, 1992 at the age of 81.  Nellie continues to live in their Piney Fork home.  She turned 95 in January 2010.
