1 NOTE <p>According ellisisland.org, Simon Cichon first sailed to the U.S. on Feb. 10, 1914 year. My father told me that in America, Simon had some heart problems. He had a wife to seduce someone. In America
2 CONC , Simon joined the Polish Army of General Haller, the army was transported to Europe and got to the Polish.</p><p><p>My father said that  at the end of the First World War Simon came home in military 
2 CONC uniform. During his stay in the house very much quarreled with his father and went into the unknown, On leaving he said that he did not see him again.  Since then, none of the family had not heard of 
2 CONC him. The second entry on ellisisland.org says Simon Cichon</p><p><p></p></p><p><p></p></p><p>This was written from  Marian Cichon  about Szymon F Cichon</p>
