1 NOTE <p>This was&nbsp; written by Traci Cihon about her Uncle passing</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h5 class="uiStreamMessage userContentWrapper"><span class="messageBody"><span class="userContent">Things I learned abo
2 CONC ut my uncle, my family, and life this week:<br /> 1. My uncle did that dance roller skating stuff when he was young though there are no pictures that document it.<br /> 2. The number in his passwords 
2 CONC had a meaning.<br />  3. You have a family by birth but many people also find more &quot;family&quot;  where they live and these individuals can be just as, if not more,  important than your birth fam
2 CONC ily.<br /> 4. Sometimes when people get sick  and die you meet more people who won&#39;t replace that person but who are  just as amazing in similar but different ways. <a href="https://www.facebook.c
2 CONC om/janet.hannahs?directed_target_id=0">Janet Hannahs</a> <a href="https://www.facebook.com/suegravelle?directed_target_id=0">Sue Gravelle</a> <a href="https://www.facebook.com/mike.lindow.12?directed_
2 CONC target_id=0">Mike Lindow</a> <span class="text_exposed_show"><br />  5. There is nothing more important than making, and taking, time to be  with those you love during the best and worst times in life
2 CONC . <a href="https://www.facebook.com/dcihon?directed_target_id=0">Dan Cihon</a> <a href="https://www.facebook.com/acihon?directed_target_id=0">Ashlee Renee</a><br />  6. Though my dad and my uncle, my 
2 CONC sister and me, my cousins and all of  us, didn&#39;t spend much time together, we are all very similar in the way  we love, forgive, and accept others.<br /> 7. My family lineage on my  dad&#39;s dad&
2 CONC #39;s side traces back to a small town in S. Poland where I still  have relatives and I can look all of that up now. <a href="https://www.facebook.com/robert.adams.39?directed_target_id=0">Robert Anth
2 CONC ony Adams</a><br />  8. We were never cihonski&#39;s; rather, we were cichon&#39;s and my great  great (and I think one more great) grandfather was afraid he would lose  his work permit in the states 
2 CONC if he asked them to spell it correctly.<br />  9. My family is deeply affected by love - in it&#39;s greatest and worst  moments -some of us crash bc of it but most of us just get stronger.</span></sp
2 CONC an></span></h5><p>&nbsp;</p>
