4 CONC rmerly of Aberdeen passed away Tuesday, August 9, 2011.  Daughter of George and Shirley (Anthony) Cooper of Aberdeen; sister of Gary Cooper and wife Judee of Edgewood, George E. &quot;Ed&quot; Cooper 
4 CONC and wife Delia of Aberdeen and the late Patty Cooper Amyx. She is also survived by nephews, Gary Cooper of Hagerstown, Keith Cooper of Edgewood, Justin Cooper Amyx of Denver, CO; and niece, Allison Co
4 CONC oper of Aberdeen. She graduated from Aberdeen High School in 1970 and had worked at Harford Community College as a secretary. Brenda&#039;s family invite friends to join with them on Friday, August 19
4 CONC  at 2pm in Harford Memorial Gardens for a graveside funeral service.
