2 CONC ne; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; background-color: #657da3; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;">EDWARD J. SABINSKY age 65, beloved husband of Laurel A. (nee Miller); loving brother of
2 CONC  Barbara (Richard) Figlio and Michael (Michelle) Drotos; uncle of Kim, Kelli, Krista, Michael Jr., Carrie, Dawn, Jamie, Heather, Amanda and Grant; son in law of Evelyn Miller; brother in law of Denise
2 CONC  (Larry) Madda and Mitchell (Melody) Miller; also survived by Ed's faithful friend (Radar). Ed was preceded in death by his parents, Edward and Helen Drotos, uncle, Albert Cernek; aunt, Micky Cernek a
2 CONC nd father in law, Mitchell Miller. Ed passed away July 29, 2014. Ed was a U.S. Navy Vietnam Veteran, a member of American Legion Post 888 and the P.L.A.V. Post 31. Ed retired from Lincoln Electric aft
2 CONC er 35 years. Funeral service Saturday, August 2 at 5:30 p.m. at BRICKMAN BROS. FUNERAL HOME, 37433 EUCLID AVE., (WILLOUGHBY), where family will receive friends Saturday from 2-6 P.M. Private Interment
2 CONC . </span></p>
