1 TITL Ohio, Marriages, 1970 - 2003
1 PUBL MyHeritage
1 TEXT In addition to the genealogical information this index provides about the marriage, these records can be useful in requesting the original marriage licenses from which this index is derived. Additiona
2 CONC l information is usually available on the original documents and may list the bride's and groom's birthplace and the names and birthplaces of their parents.
2 CONC 
2 CONC To obtain copies of marriage certificates you can write to the Probate Court in the county where the marriage occurred. A list of the counties and the addresses to write to is available on the <A href
2 CONC ="http://www.franklincountyohio.gov/probate/ohio_judges.cfm" target="_blank">Ohio Department of Health</a> website.
